itories unoccupied by other forces. A total of 46 different cities exist, as well as hundreds of unique characters. Each character has several statistics: War Ability, Intelligence, Politics, Charisma, Army Command, Naval Command.\n\nThe player wins the game by conquering all territories in China. This is accomplished by being in control of every city on the map.", "themes": [{"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sangokushi-iii", "videos": [{"id": 179838, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "H6Nh-g3qEOY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H6Nh-g3qEOY", "title": "Romance of the Three Kingdoms III Intro (\u4e09\u570b\u5fd7III) ps1-pcengine", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/H6Nh-g3qEOY/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 766, "name": "Romance of the Three Kingdoms (Koei)"}]}